 "srcKey": "SB_u11_p105_t05",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "t": 9.56,
   "t2": 11.2,
   "en": "Are you all right, Lydia?",
   "zh": "你还好吗，莉迪娅？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "t": 11.92,
   "t2": 13.54,
   "en": "No, I’m not, Dad.",
   "zh": "不，爸爸，我不太好。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "t": 13.98,
   "t2": 15.36,
   "en": "I’m not well at all.",
   "zh": "我一点都不舒服。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "t": 15.7,
   "t2": 16.94,
   "en": "What’s the matter with you?",
   "zh": "你怎么了？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "t": 17.36,
   "t2": 19.92,
   "en": "I’ve got a really bad stomach ache.",
   "zh": "我肚子很疼。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "t": 20.5,
   "t2": 22.4,
   "en": "Do you think it was something you ate?",
   "zh": "你觉得是吃坏东西了吗？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "t": 22.84,
   "t2": 24.8,
   "en": "No, not just one thing.",
   "zh": "不，不只是一样东西。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "t": 25.2,
   "t2": 26.16,
   "en": "She ate loads.",
   "zh": "她吃了好多。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "t": 26.68,
   "t2": 28.04,
   "en": "Don’t be mean, Liam.",
   "zh": "别这么说，利亚姆。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "t": 28.607,
   "t2": 30.34,
   "en": "Your sister doesn’t feel great.",
   "zh": "你姐姐不舒服。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "t": 30.92,
   "t2": 31.98,
   "en": "He’s right, Dad.",
   "zh": "他说得对，爸爸。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "t": 32.78,
   "t2": 34.38,
   "en": "I think I was too hungry.",
   "zh": "我想我是太饿了。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "t": 35.06,
   "t2": 37.4,
   "en": "I didn’t have any lunch at school today.",
   "zh": "我今天在学校没吃午饭。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "t": 38.04,
   "t2": 41.8,
   "en": "I think you need to just go and lie down for a while.",
   "zh": "我觉得你需要去躺一会儿。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "t": 42.423,
   "t2": 44.18,
   "en": "I’m sure you’ll feel better soon.",
   "zh": "我相信你很快就会好起来。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "t": 44.687,
   "t2": 45.44,
   "en": "OK, Dad.",
   "zh": "好的，爸爸。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "t": 45.86,
   "t2": 46.24,
   "en": "I will.",
   "zh": "我会的。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "t": 46.82,
   "t2": 48.24,
   "en": "I’ll just try and rest.",
   "zh": "我会尽量休息。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "t": 48.44,
   "t2": 50.1,
   "en": "And don’t worry about the washing-up.",
   "zh": "别担心洗碗的事。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "t": 50.968,
   "t2": 52.96,
   "en": "I’m sure your brother will do that.",
   "zh": "我相信你哥哥会做的。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "t": 53.4,
   "t2": 53.7,
   "en": "What?",
   "zh": "什么？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "t": 54.2,
   "t2": 54.54,
   "en": "Me??!!",
   "zh": "我？！",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "t": 61.28,
   "t2": 62.36,
   "en": "Come in, Tim.",
   "zh": "请进，蒂姆。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "t": 62.84,
   "t2": 63.74,
   "en": "Take a seat.",
   "zh": "请坐。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "t": 64.1,
   "t2": 64.74,
   "en": "Thank you, Doctor.",
   "zh": "谢谢你，医生。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "t": 65.22,
   "t2": 67.22,
   "en": "So how can I help you today?",
   "zh": "今天我能怎么帮你？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "t": 67.76,
   "t2": 68.66,
   "en": "It’s my elbow.",
   "zh": "是我的胳膊肘。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "t": 69.18,
   "t2": 70.1,
   "en": "It’s really painful.",
   "zh": "真的很疼。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "t": 70.82,
   "t2": 71.0,
   "en": "Look.",
   "zh": "你看。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "t": 71.5,
   "t2": 76.18,
   "en": "Hmm, yes, it does look a bit bruised.",
   "zh": "嗯，是的，确实有点淤青。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "t": 76.72,
   "t2": 78.0,
   "en": "So what happened?",
   "zh": "那是怎么回事？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "t": 78.52,
   "t2": 81.04,
   "en": "Well, it’s a bit of a silly story really.",
   "zh": "嗯，这其实有点傻。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "t": 81.64,
   "t2": 85.5,
   "en": "I got home from school yesterday and I didn’t have my key with me.",
   "zh": "我昨天放学回家时没带钥匙。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "t": 85.5,
   "t2": 90.8,
   "en": "I left it in my locker at school so I tried to open the door with my elbow.",
   "zh": "我把钥匙落在学校的储物柜里了，所以试着用胳膊肘开门。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "t": 91.42,
   "t2": 93.36,
   "en": "Oh, I see.",
   "zh": "哦，我明白了。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "t": 94.04,
   "t2": 96.2,
   "en": "And it didn’t open?",
   "zh": "门没打开？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "t": 96.8,
   "t2": 98.26,
   "en": "No, it didn’t.",
   "zh": "没有，没打开。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "t": 98.62,
   "t2": 101.64,
   "en": "Well, I don’t think it’s anything too serious.",
   "zh": "嗯，我觉得没什么太严重的问题。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "t": 102.2,
   "t2": 107.24,
   "en": "You need to put some ice on it, and take some painkillers if it hurts too much.",
   "zh": "你需要用冰敷一下，如果太疼就吃点止痛药。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "t": 107.66,
   "t2": 109.48,
   "en": "So, it’s not broken?",
   "zh": "那么，骨头没断吧？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "t": 109.88,
   "t2": 111.1,
   "en": "No, it isn’t.",
   "zh": "没有，没断。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "t": 111.58,
   "t2": 114.42,
   "en": "You’re able to move it so I’m not too worried.",
   "zh": "你还能活动它，所以我不太担心。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "t": 114.42,
   "t2": 120.22,
   "en": "But next time you forget your key, just wait for your parents to get home.",
   "zh": "不过下次忘了带钥匙，就等你父母回家。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "t": 120.56,
   "t2": 121.28,
   "en": "OK, Doctor.",
   "zh": "好的，医生。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "t": 121.8,
   "t2": 122.18,
   "en": "I will.",
   "zh": "我会的。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "t": 128.8,
   "t2": 129.82,
   "en": "Hello, John.",
   "zh": "你好，约翰。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "t": 130.52,
   "t2": 131.82,
   "en": "What can I do for you?",
   "zh": "我能帮你什么？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "t": 132.1,
   "t2": 133.06,
   "en": "It’s my neck.",
   "zh": "是我的脖子。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "t": 133.7,
   "t2": 134.34,
   "en": "OK.",
   "zh": "好。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "t": 135.059,
   "t2": 137.1,
   "en": "And what’s the problem with it?",
   "zh": "那它有什么问题？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "t": 137.62,
   "t2": 138.22,
   "en": "Does it hurt?",
   "zh": "疼吗？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "t": 138.7,
   "t2": 139.58,
   "en": "Yes, it does.",
   "zh": "疼。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "t": 140.2,
   "t2": 141.62,
   "en": "I can hardly move it.",
   "zh": "我几乎不能转动它。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "t": 141.62,
   "t2": 142.38,
   "en": "Oh dear.",
   "zh": "哎呀。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "t": 143.256,
   "t2": 144.24,
   "en": "What happened?",
   "zh": "发生了什么事？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "t": 144.8,
   "t2": 145.64,
   "en": "I’m not sure.",
   "zh": "我不确定。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "t": 146.32,
   "t2": 150.78,
   "en": "I went to bed last night and when I woke up it was really hurting.",
   "zh": "我昨晚睡觉，醒来时它疼得厉害。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "t": 153.06,
   "t2": 155.52,
   "en": "Did you do any sport yesterday?",
   "zh": "你昨天做运动了吗？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "t": 156.58,
   "t2": 157.86,
   "en": "No, I didn’t.",
   "zh": "没有。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "t": 158.48,
   "t2": 161.1,
   "en": "But I did sleep with the window open.",
   "zh": "但我确实开着窗户睡觉了。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "t": 161.74,
   "t2": 166.8,
   "en": "My grandmother thinks the cold air made it hurt but I’m not so sure.",
   "zh": "我奶奶觉得是冷空气让它疼，但我不太确定。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "t": 167.474,
   "t2": 170.74,
   "en": "No, I don’t think there’s any connection there.",
   "zh": "不，我觉得这没有关系。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "t": 171.66,
   "t2": 175.02,
   "en": "OK, well, let’s have a look at it.",
   "zh": "好，那我们来看看它。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "t": 175.56,
   "t2": 177.86,
   "en": "Can you take your shirt off for me, please?",
   "zh": "请把衬衫脱掉好吗？",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "t": 178.46,
   "t2": 178.72,
   "en": "Sure.",
   "zh": "当然。",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "src": "tb-text"
  }
 ]
}